<title>USA: PHLX to list four new equity options on June 3.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list four new equity options on June 3.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said it will list options on shares of NaPro BioTherapeutics Inc, Sybron International Corp, York Research Corp and Zions Bancorp on June 3.</p>
<p>Initial strike prices, position limits and specialists for the new options are as follows:</p>
<p>stock	strikes	   limits	 Specialist</p>
<p>NPRO.O    5, 7-1/2, 10     4,500	 Group One Ltd</p>
<p>SYB.N     30, 35, 40	 4,500	 Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg</p>
<p>YORK.O    5, 7-1/2, 10     4,500	 Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg</p>
<p>ZION.O    25, 30, 35	 7,500	 Penn Options Co</p>
<p>Initial expirations for Napro and Sybron options are in June, July, August and November. Expirations for York options will be June, July, September and December, while those for Zions options are June, July, October and January.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
